16f7af0274f7.plain:
When you give this Relic to a model, choose one bolt weapon that model has. Each time the model is picked to shoot, you can have that weapon fire a Morbidus bolt. If you do, that weapon makes only 1 attack, but if it hits:
• the target suffers 2 mortal wounds and the attack sequence stops;
• until the end of the turn, subtract 1 from that enemy unit's Combat Attrition tests.

5592c6025739.plain:
In the Fight phase, when one of your SILVER TEMPLARS PRIMARIS units is picked to fight: if, at the moment it was picked, it was within Engagement Range of an enemy unit with more models than it has, then until the end of the phase, for each attack a model in that SILVER TEMPLARS unit makes:
• add 1 to the attack's Strength;
• improve the attack's Armour Penetration by 1.

b100d740a3ca.plain:
In your opponent's Charge phase: choose a CASTELLANS OF THE RIFT unit of yours. For the rest of the phase:
• it can make Heroic Interventions as though it were a CHARACTER;
• it can make a Heroic Intervention if an enemy unit is within 6" horizontally and 5" vertically of it;
• when it makes a Heroic Intervention move, its models may move up to 6" rather than 3". All the other Heroic Intervention rules still apply.

f2e192f187a5.plain:
In your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when you pick one of your CASTELLANS OF THE RIFT units to shoot or fight: until the end of the phase, for each attack its models make:
• if the unit is below its Starting Strength, the attack's Armour Penetration is improved by 1;
• if the unit is below Half-strength, you can re-roll the wound roll.
